Hello !
Your email adress being in english I will write in this language, I excuse
in advance for every mistake I may do...

My name is Axel Brulavoine, I am french and I started recently to get
interrested by the lojban language (I already tried esperanto but I didn't
like it...), so I looked for "tutorials", lessons, and I found the Wave
Lessons (at the URL mw.lojban.org/papri/Lojban_Wave_Lessons).

It is hard to find any other content like this one on the web so I wrote
this email to ask you : Do you know if their is any quality french lojban
lessons available ?

If you don't, what is the latest version of the Wave Lessons ? Would you
allow me to (try to) translate this version (so the latest) of the Wave
Lessons in french for french-speaking beginners like me ? I would be happy
to do so !

-- 
